{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「北一女神」之稱的蔡瑞雪24日突在IG貼出多張照片，並寫道「婚後生活」，讓不少網友都很吃驚，而老公身分是一位醫美醫師，兩人看起來很登對。</p><p>上個月才過完30歲生日的蔡瑞雪，無預警的拋出結婚喜訊，並貼出與老公的甜蜜合照，從照片中可以看出男方長相帥氣，而且是一位醫美醫師，目前在一間醫美診所擔任院長，從他個人IG可以見到很喜愛法拉利的跑車。</p><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪貼出與老公登記結婚的畫面。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201950999506325504402759.png/uhsVT_dy5uk_cjNoMUiTXoqwk07aQAg0F1PWQxdT1kM\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪貼出與老公登記結婚的畫面。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪突宣布結婚。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201951002236948480358401.jpeg/gUmFMQ0NAhgDW1b5uUBzna4O6pvxOIWPf2O5239juds\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪突宣布結婚。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪突宣布結婚。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201951005114372096349752.jpeg/xfzVCXl2VwPq5oOVr1FjiteZQyczGwVv90vX4fdL1-E\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪突宣布結婚。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪突宣布結婚。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201951007870160896671824.jpeg/wrlh484j7Ay-IY5wobq26rtAIQVnt7tJVUelR1VHpUc\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪突宣布結婚。（Instagram＠snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><p>蔡瑞雪之後回應「鏡報」，證實上個月結婚也否認懷孕，強調目前還不想當媽媽，並透露會嫁給醫師老公的原因：</p><blockquote><p>對方很溫柔、善良，凡事為我著想，把我放第一。</p></blockquote><p>另外婚禮預計會在明年舉行，最近在準備拍攝婚紗照。</p><p>蔡瑞雪的醫師老公其實早在5日就曾在IG限動，曬出蔡瑞雪的身分證，只見配偶欄上就印著「蔡沁晁」也就是蔡醫師的本名，顯示自己已經升格為人夫。稍早蔡瑞雪也在IG限動貼出與老公去戶政事務所登記結婚的照片，笑稱因為太多人來問「真的假的」，證明自己是人妻了。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：蔡瑞雪人設崩壞　驚爆搭上已婚雜誌高層　同遊日本共返愛巢遭斷正】蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804940993368064071258.jpeg/CR4M5wrlUouz5axcuAqIVRt-wIpzwlUBpC5IVKQuSFQ\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：蔡瑞雪人設崩壞　驚爆搭上已婚雜誌高層　同遊日本共返愛巢遭斷正】蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「那個凱文」王凱文（Instagram@thatmrwang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105837152329011200240397.jpeg/f8xX4C_L6yJ8r0fWy1HUtOL-TRdbuJ_3OWQJUDlkCVA\"/><figcaption>「那個凱文」王凱文（Instagram@thatmrwang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804940993368064071258.jpeg/CR4M5wrlUouz5axcuAqIVRt-wIpzwlUBpC5IVKQuSFQ\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804936727629824517234.jpeg/q2Gn4ejERHI2uGWZQRLssDPj8OjBDOeV7fTxdO308XQ\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804937558102016350689.jpeg/qsXFDXP9nqkccb5hpPjEWGH_QrK6yQT7FjwaRhY8GkY\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804937683931136978640.jpeg/680MANw-j82D-akCMiLoZ0lvUIAmuPV1mHQAUJh0AFA\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804938698952704354279.jpeg/WA2yP2JvdB8gIpHN3tTc3qeYawtLPmsAPysjWT8rI1k\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804939181428736309857.jpeg/zO6MJ1iVwprHoJAnpn3DceGsP_hF2Kdx1i90YNYvdGA\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804939978346496714523.jpeg/syzKCod-ZYE1Ad_cVSqtz_KO9D3AYyMTH93YtB_d2LQ\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105804940217421824265190.jpeg/mlcLVnEAn62KmSQzmyVv7v382ZTxAgfl-SDdLfkg3S0\"/><figcaption>蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡瑞雪（Instagram@snowbabyq）\